  "markdown": {
    "instructions": "SODAX is mainnet-only (no testnet chains or RPC endpoints exist) with a hub-and-spoke architecture; Sonic is the hub. For frontend/React integrations, prefer @sodax/dapp-kit hooks over calling @sodax/sdk directly. Every public SDK method returns Result<T, E> ({ ok: true, value } or { ok: false, error }) — check result.ok, never wrap calls in try/catch or branch on error.message; discriminate on the narrow error.code union instead."
  },
